 ch_Dele_and_Aminatas_Jollof_War.png?cb=1789072874
DESCRIPTION:📚🚀Want some delicious\, fragrant jollof rice? Then\, you
 're invited to join Yewande Daniel-Ayoade\, co-author of the new book DELE
  & AMINATA'S JOLLOF WAR\, for the launch of her debut book!\nEnfolded in D
 ELE & AMINATA'S JOLLOF WAR\, a story about two African children\, Dele and
  Aminata\, who both believe that their versions of jollof rice are worthy 
 of first prize at the neighbourhood competition\, is a note on the history
  of the signature dish of West Africa\, plus a jollof rice recipe that chi
 ldren will be excited to try!\nReaders will have the pleasure of listening
  to Yewande read her story\, participating in a Q&A\, winning prizes\, and
  of course tasting some jollof rice and snacks inspired by the book!\nPreo
 rder DELE & AMINATA'S JOLLOF WAR\, by Yewande Daniel and Bri Marie McNish 
 (illus.) now\, or purchase it - and have it signed by the author at the ev
 ent.\nAdmission: Free.\nAll are welcome - #ReadDifferently and #EatDiffere
 ntly!📚
LOCATION:BLACKHURST CULTURAL CENTRE
URL:https://adifferentbooklist.com/events
